#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Titanium 1"
msgstr "Titanio 1"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a chunk of titanium ore and bring it to the converter."
msgstr "Prendi un pezzo di minerale di titanio e portalo al convertitore."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Titanium1"
msgstr "Titanium1"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Objective"
msgstr "Obiettivo"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Write a program that takes a chunk of <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a> "
"and drops in on the <a object|convert>converter</a> in order to produce a <a"
" object|titan>titanium cube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Scrivi un programma che prenda <a object|titanore>minerale di titanio</a> e "
"lo posi sul <a object|convert>convertitore</a> per produrre un <a "
"object|titan>cubo di titanio</a>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Program"
msgstr "Programma"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "You will need a new instruction:"
msgstr "Ti servirà una nuova istruzione:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "move();<n/>"
msgstr "move();<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instructs the bot to move forward or backward. The distance of the move is "
"given in brackets in meters: <c/>move(10);<n/> moves the bot 10m forward, "
"<c/>move(-1);<n/> moves the bot 1m backward."
msgstr ""
"Fa avanzare o arretrare il robot della distanza indicata fra parentesi, in "
"metri: <c/>move(10);<n/> avanza di 10 m, <c/>move(-1);<n/> arretra di 1 m."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instructions <code><a cbot|turn>turn</a>()</code>, <code><a "
"cbot|grab>grab</a>()</code> and <code><a cbot|drop>drop</a>()</code> have "
"already been explained in the previous exercises. If you have any questions "
"about these instructions, click the name of the instruction underlined in "
"blue, and an explanation of the instruction will appear."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|turn>turn</a>()</code>, <code><a cbot|grab>grab</a>()</code> e"
" <code><a cbot|drop>drop</a>()</code> sono già state spiegate. Per "
"chiarimenti, fai clic sul nome sottolineato in blu."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a> is 20m in front of the bot, the <a "
"object|convert>converter</a> is 10m behind the bot. After dropping the "
"titanium ore on the converter, do not forget to move back (for example "
"<c/>move(-2.5);<n/>) so as to allow the converter to get down to work."
msgstr ""
"Il <a object|titanore>minerale</a> è 20 m davanti al robot e il <a "
"object|convert>convertitore</a> 10 m dietro. Dopo aver posato il minerale, "
"arretra (per esempio con <c/>move(-2.5);<n/>) per consentire la conversione."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> permette di rileggere queste istruzioni in "
"ogni momento."
